{"root":"cengeng","ipa":"/tʃəŋəŋ/","core":"形容一个人性格软弱、容易哭泣、缺乏坚韧意志或容易受挫。","pos":["形容词"],"scenes":["高频","生活"],"rootBlock":{"ipa":"/tʃəŋəŋ/","zh":"软弱的，爱哭的，脆弱的","phrases":[{"t":"jangan cengeng","zh":"别那么软弱"},{"t":"sikap cengeng","zh":"软弱的态度"},{"t":"anak yang cengeng","zh":"爱哭的孩子"}],"examples":[{"t":"Dia tidak mau menjadi orang yang cengeng saat menghadapi masalah.","zh":"他不想在面对问题时成为一个软弱的人。"},{"t":"Berhentilah bersikap cengeng dan mulailah berjuang.","zh":"停止表现得软弱，开始奋斗吧。"}]},"ders":[{"w":"cengeng","ipa":"/tʃəŋəŋ/","zh":"软弱的，爱哭的","phrase":{"t":"sangat cengeng","zh":"非常软弱"},"example":{"t":"Jangan jadi anak cengeng.","zh":"别做一个爱哭的孩子。"}},{"w":"kecengengan","ipa":"/kətʃəŋəŋan/","zh":"软弱性，爱哭的习性","phrase":{"t":"sifat kecengengan","zh":"软弱的性格特征"},"example":{"t":"Kecengengan itu harus segera dihilangkan.","zh":"那种软弱的习性必须尽快改掉。"}}],"derSlugs":["cengeng","kecengengan"],"model":"gemini-3.1-flash-lite","createdAt":"2026-10-01T02:04:38.324Z","src":"base"}